      "body": "Unpickling `MMapIndexedDataset` raises `TypeError`, preventing spawned DataLoader workers from reading it. Adding a default alone also silently re-enables a full-file warmup in every worker.\n\nSave the dataset path and `skip_warmup` together, and restore both. Legacy path-only states retain the original default.\n\nTest: `DS_ACCELERATOR=cpu PYTHONPATH=. python -m pytest tests/unit/runtime/test_data.py -k 'mmap or repeating_loader' -q`. Six tests pass, covering both warmup settings, signed/unsigned storage, legacy states and a real spawned DataLoader. The two skipped-warmup cases fail before the follow-up. Changed-file pre-commit passes. Apple M2 Pro CPU.\n",
